# Environment Variables for Vercel Deployment

# Required Environment Variables:
# NODE_ENV=production
# PORT=3000
# MONGODB_URL=your_mongodb_connection_string

# Add these to your Vercel project dashboard:
# 1. Go to your Vercel project dashboard
# 2. Navigate to Settings > Environment Variables
# 3. Add the following variables:

# NODE_ENV: production
# MONGODB_URL: Your MongoDB connection string (e.g., mongodb+srv://...)
# PORT: 3000 (optional, Vercel will handle this)

# Additional variables based on your configuration:
# Add any other environment variables your app requires